<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PDN - Portable Draughts Notation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .fmjd-logo {
            max-width: 200px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .links {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .links a {
            display: block;
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding: 5px;
        }

        .links a:hover {
            color: #0056b3;
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .description {
            text-align: justify;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            color: #6c757d;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>PDN - Portable Draughts Notation</h1>
            <a href="https://fmjd.org" target="_blank"><img src="https://fmjd.org/logos/logo1.svg" alt="FMJD Logo" class="fmjd-logo"></a>
        </div>

        <div class="description">
            <p>This document defines the official portable draughts notation standard, PDN 3.0. <br>
                The goal of this document is to give a formal definition of PDN.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="links">
            <h2>Documentation Links</h2>
            <a href="https://github.com/wiegerw/pdn" target="_blank">📁 GitHub Repository</a>
            <a href="https://wiegerw.github.io/pdn/" target="_blank">🌐 HTML Documentation</a>
            <a href="https://wiegerw.github.io/pdn/pdf/pdn_standard.pdf" target="_blank">📄 PDF Documentation</a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Special thanks to <strong>Wieger Wesselink</strong> for developing and maintaining the PDN documentation.</p>
            <p>Under the auspices of <a href="https://www.fmjd.org" target="_blank">FMJD</a> (World Draughts Federation)</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 